{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 10, :comments ["<b>And a man — his holy things shall be his.</b> This teaches about every priest that if he wishes, he may go and offer his own offerings, and is not required to hand them over to the men of the watch." "<b>A man who gives to the priest — it shall be his.</b> This teaches: if the father of a firstborn gave the redemption of the firstborn to the priest before thirty days have been completed for him, and the firstborn dies within thirty days, the priest returns the redemption to the father of the son."], :book :numbers, :voice :chizkuni, :lang :en, :chapter 5, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T15:16:32.731755820Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}